    "The baseline → objective-only → fused sequence does not isolate the recent branch’s effect from the added LayerNorm and parameters. Include a normalization-matched control and simple ungated recent pooling. The proposed gate is context-dependent, not candidate-dependent, so compatibility claims remain unsupported.",
    "The sampled-softmax objective needs its own justification: gSASRec establishes generalized BCE, not this loss. Sampling with or without replacement, duplicate handling, temperature, masking, and loss reduction remain unspecified.",
